+# Design audit after Issues 935 and 936 (2026-10-16)
+
+The audit at `465ff928c1f2ceb9f9b8f8084465475e45799ee8` evaluated types,
+compatibility remnants and duplicated state. It filed Issues 939–943 for report
+configuration decoding, synthetic outcome ownership, common stop routing,
+workspace slot ownership and redundant bookkeeping. The report distinguishes
+static design findings from a reproduced current-schema report-reader acceptance
+difference and records intentional caches/lifecycle distinctions that should
+remain separate. The fixes are pending; the audit does not establish their
+implementation or a new whole-workspace test result.[^post938-design-audit]
+
